AQUHEL_data_SSR - GenAlEx compatible empirical microsatellite (SSR) data from Aquila heliaca populations used for the manuscript 'Anthropogenic fragmentation shapes recent genetic differentiation in the widespread but philopatric eastern imperial eagle Aquila heliaca'
AQUHEL_data_mtDNA - GenAlEx compatible empirical mitochondrial control region (Domain I) sequence data from Aquila heliaca populations used for the manuscript 'Anthropogenic fragmentation shapes recent genetic differentiation in the widespread but philopatric eastern imperial eagle Aquila heliaca'
